  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives are to stabilize the power services in Dili, by restoring or improving operational efficiency, reliability, safety and availability of the power supply, and to promote long-term sustainability of the power sector.  These would, in turn, contribute to the social stability and economic development of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
